    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAHUR: Escape Together</strong> \u2013 A cooperative survival horror game for 1-4 players. Band together to survive a night of terror and stop the deranged Sahur. Explore dangerous streets, scavenge for resources, and stay clear of his minions\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key genres:</strong> Horror, memes, action, coop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What makes it special?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart AI that adapts to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rising difficulty as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated elements for unique gameplay every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both cooperative and solo modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meme-worthy characters like <i>Tung Tung Tung Sahur</i>, <i>Tralalero Tralala</i>, and <i>Balerino Capucino</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: This game is a work of fiction. Any resemblance to real events or persons is purely coincidental. It does not promote or endorse any ideology, nor is it intended to offend or harm anyone.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAHUR: Escape Together</strong> \u2013 A cooperative survival horror game for 1-4 players. Band together to survive a night of terror and stop the deranged Sahur. Explore dangerous streets, scavenge for resources, and stay clear of his minions\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key genres:</strong> Horror, memes, action, coop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What makes it special?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart AI that adapts to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rising difficulty as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated elements for unique gameplay every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both cooperative and solo modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meme-worthy characters like <i>Tung Tung Tung Sahur</i>, <i>Tralalero Tralala</i>, and <i>Balerino Capucino</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: This game is a work of fiction. Any resemblance to real events or persons is purely coincidental. It does not promote or endorse any ideology, nor is it intended to offend or harm anyone.</i></p>",
